{"ref":"BDB, בֹּ֫הֶן","hw":"בֹּ֫הֶן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּ֫הֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>f.</strong>] (cf. Sta<sup>§ 310 c</sup>) c. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַד</span> <strong>thumb</strong>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶגֶל</span> <strong>great toe (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">إِبْهَامٌ</span> & (vulg.) <span dir=\"rtl\">بَاهِمٌ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">بِهَامٌ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> only cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:20\" href=\"/Exodus.29.20\">Ex 29:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 12 times; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֹנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:6\" href=\"/Judges.1.6\">Ju 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:7\" href=\"/Judges.1.7\">7</a> (from sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">[בְּהוֹן]</span> as always Cod. Sam. for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּהֶן</span>);—<em>thumb</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יָדָם) בּ׳ יָדוֹ</span>, & <em>great toe</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(רַגְלָם) בּ׳ רַגְלוֹ</span> (always named together) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:20\" href=\"/Exodus.29.20\">Ex 29:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.23\">Lv 8:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.24\">24</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.14\">14:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.28\">28</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֹנוֹת י׳ וְר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:6\" href=\"/Judges.1.6\">Ju 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:7\" href=\"/Judges.1.7\">7</a>.","next":"BDB, בֹּ֫הַן","prev":"BDB, בהן"}